# Seed data for the `trusted` egress preset: an agent created with it gets one
# allow rule per host below. Newline-delimited, `#` comments ignored; the
# api-server reads it once at boot.
#
# Curated to mirror Anthropic's published default-allowed-domain list for
# Claude Code so harnesses with "claude --trust-defaults" behavior keep
# working without per-host inbox prompts:
#   https://code.claude.com/docs/en/claude-code-on-the-web#default-allowed-domains
#
# Rules are seeded once at agent-create time, so editing this list does not
# retroactively touch existing agents — they keep whatever was seeded for them.

